AUTHOR'S NOTE (INFORMATIONAL):

This project was created strictly for educational purposes to study 
wireless communication (Bluetooth Low Energy) between mobile applications, 
desktop applications, and a microcontroller (ESP32). 

We strongly discourage using this code for commercial purposes without 
making your own significant contribution to its development. If you wish 
to use it in your project, it is best to treat it as a learning base and 
write your own implementation.
